   "details": "<p>The FBI's San Francisco Field Office and the Belmont Police Department in California are seeking information from the public regarding the disappearance of Ylva Annika Hagner.  She was last seen at approximately 9:30 p.m., on October 14, 1996, at her place of employment in Belmont, California.  At the time of her disappearance, Hagner was living in Palo Alto, California, and attending Stanford University as a Graduate Student.  Her vehicle was located abandoned in front of a Days Inn Motel in San Carlos, California, on October 16, 1996. The keys were in the ignition, and her purse was missing.  </p>",
