   "details": "<p>On August 30, 1979, Carlotta Maria Sanchez, accompanied by her cousin, <a data-urltype=\"/view\" data-val=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/kidnap/elsie-eldora-luscier\" href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/kidnap/elsie-eldora-luscier\" data-linktype=\"external\">Elsie Eldora Luscier</a>, disappeared from Taholah, Washington, which is in the Quinault Nation Indian Reservation.  The FBI is seeking information about the disappearance of both girls, and about those responsible for their disappearance.</p>\r\n<p> </p>",
